@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant "System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : starts the simulation
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a list of the available maps
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects the map
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a list of the available scenarios
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects the scenario
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a list of the cities
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects a city
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a list of the actions the player can do
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects to upgrade a station
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a list of the available stations
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects the station
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a list of existing buildings in the station and those who are available to build.


    System --> Player : requests the type of the building.
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : inserts the type of the building
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows a message about the success of the operation, including the data received
    deactivate System

@enduml